@startuml
title 5.2 SePay Return, Reconcile and Cancel (no webhook) - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "SePay Gateway\n(checkout page)" as SEPAY <<External>> #FFE0E0
participant "SePay REST API\n(/v1/order/detail, /v1/order/cancel)" as API <<External>> #FFE0E0
participant PaymentReturnController as RC <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant PaymentController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant PaymentService as PS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant SePayGatewayService as GW <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderService as OS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant PaymentRepository as PR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant OrderRepository as OR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9

== A. Checkout created (see 10.2 D and 8.6 for the signed form) ==
note over GW
  Signed fields: success_url = app.frontend-base-url + /payment/success?invoice_number=...
  (same for error_url and cancel_url). sepay.* URL properties override the default.
end note
V -> SEPAY : POST signed form (sent by View)

== B. Customer result on the gateway ==
alt paid
  SEPAY -> U : redirect success_url
else gateway error
  SEPAY -> U : redirect error_url
else customer leaves with cancel button or back
  SEPAY -> U : redirect cancel_url
end
note over SEPAY
  SePay never calls this backend (no webhook). The return URL only
  brings the browser back. Money is confirmed only by reconcile in D.
end note

== C. Return URL on the backend host ==
opt the configured return URL points to the backend host
  U -> RC : GET /payment/{success|error|cancel}?invoice_number=...
  alt same scheme, host and port as frontend-base-url
    RC --> U : forward:/index.html (frontend served by the same host)
  else other host
    RC --> U : 302 redirect to frontend /payment/{result}?query
  end
end

== D. Success page polls for the result ==
U -> V : /payment/success?invoice_number=...
loop up to 10 times, every 2.5 seconds, until isPaid or CANCELLED
  V -> C : GET /api/payments/status-by-invoice/{invoice}
  C -> GW : getStatusByInvoice(invoice, userId)
  alt group invoice (GRP-...)
    GW --> C : group status (all orders paid, not cancelled)
  else single invoice
    GW -> PR : findByInvoiceNumber(invoice)
    alt unknown invoice
      GW --> C : 404 Không tìm thấy thông tin thanh toán với mã hóa đơn
    else found
      alt payment owner is not the caller
        GW --> C : 403 Bạn không có quyền xem thông tin giao dịch này.
      else owner
        alt payment ONLINE, not SUCCESS, order not CANCELLED
          GW -> API : GET /v1/order/detail/{invoice} (Basic auth, 6 s timeout)
          alt HTTP not 2xx, timeout, or order_status not CAPTURED
            API --> GW : no change
          else CAPTURED
            API --> GW : order_amount, order_id, order_invoice_number
            alt invoice mismatch or amount text missing
              GW -> GW : no change
            else amount compared with Payment.amount (in transaction, order and payment locked)
              alt Payment.amount differs
                GW -> PR : Payment FAILED, gatewayResponse AMOUNT_MISMATCH (order unchanged)
              else Payment already SUCCESS
                GW -> GW : ALREADY_PAID (no change)
              else order is in the expected state
                GW -> PR : Payment SUCCESS, transactionNo
                alt paymentType is DEPOSIT (order AWAITING_DEPOSIT or PENDING)
                  GW -> OR : status = DEPOSIT_PAID
                else FULL (PENDING) or FINAL (DEPOSIT_PAID)
                  GW -> OR : status = PROCESSING
                end
                GW -> GW : notifyPaymentSuccess(order, paymentType)
              else order not in expected state (cancelled, already paid by another invoice)
                GW -> PR : Payment SUCCESS (money is real)
                GW -> OR : create Refund REQUESTED, notify staff (order unchanged)
              end
            end
          end
        end
        GW -> PR : reload Payment
        GW --> C : PaymentStatusResponse(isPaid, orderStatus, paymentStatus,\npaymentType, depositAmount, totalPaid, remainingAmount, message)
      end
    end
  end
  C --> V : 200 status
end
alt isPaid = true
  V --> U : payment confirmed
else orderStatus = CANCELLED
  V --> U : cancelled message
else still PENDING after 10 tries
  V --> U : still waiting
end

== E. Error page ==
U -> V : /payment/error?invoice_number=...
V --> U : error message only (the View makes no backend call)

== F. Cancel page routes the customer (no SePay cancel call) ==
U -> V : /payment/cancel?invoice_number=...
alt not logged in
  V --> U : /login?next=/payment/cancel?invoice_number=...
else logged in, invoice missing
  V --> U : /payment/error
else logged in
  loop up to 5 retries, every 2 seconds on network error
    V -> C : GET /api/payments/status-by-invoice/{invoice}
    C -> GW : getStatusByInvoice (same reconcile as D)
    alt isPaid
      V --> U : /payment/success?invoice_number=...
    else orderStatus = CANCELLED
      V --> U : /payment/error?invoice_number=...
    else paymentType DEPOSIT or FINAL
      V --> U : /orders/{orderId} (order page resumes the rest)
    else other
      V --> U : /payment/pending?order=... (one or more ids)
    end
  end
  alt still failing after 5 retries
    V --> U : /payment/error
  end
end
note over V
  frontend paymentService.cancelCheckout exists but no page calls it.
  Cancel at SePay happens only through the endpoint in H.
end note

== G. Order-level status (CustomOrderPayment, status-by-order) ==
V -> C : GET /api/payments/status-by-order/{orderId}
C -> PS : checkPaymentStatus(orderId, userId)
alt not owner
  PS --> C : 403
else owner
  alt order not CANCELLED and latest Payment is ONLINE and not SUCCESS
    PS -> GW : reconcileWithSePayGateway(invoice)
    note over GW : same GET /v1/order/detail as D
  end
  PS --> C : status (isPaid, nextPaymentType DEPOSIT or FINAL, remainingAmount)
end

== H. Cancel at SePay: POST /api/payments/sepay/cancel/{invoice} ==
U -> C : POST /api/payments/sepay/cancel/{invoice}
C -> GW : cancelCheckout(invoice, userId)
alt group invoice (GRP-...)
  GW -> GW : cancelGroupCheckout: owner check for every member (403),\nPOST /v1/order/cancel, reconcile, then cancelPendingOrder for each member
  GW --> C : {paid: true} if reconcile saw money, otherwise {paid: false}
else single invoice
  alt Payment not found
    GW --> C : 404 Không tìm thấy giao dịch cần hủy.
  else found
    alt caller is not the order owner
      GW --> C : 403 Bạn không có quyền hủy giao dịch này.
    else owner
      alt payment method is COD
        GW --> C : 400 Giao dịch này không thuộc cổng SePay.
      else ONLINE
        alt payment SUCCESS, or order PROCESSING
          GW --> C : {paid: true}, nothing cancelled
        else order CANCELLED
          GW -> OS : restoreCancelledOrderItems(order)
          GW --> C : {paid: false}
        else order not PENDING (deposit invoice in AWAITING_DEPOSIT,\nor final invoice in DEPOSIT_PAID)
          GW --> C : {paid: false}\nno SePay call, order and invoice unchanged
        else order PENDING (full online payment)
          GW -> API : POST /v1/order/cancel {order_invoice_number}\n(failure only logged)
          GW -> API : GET /v1/order/detail (reconcile)
          alt money captured
            GW -> PR : apply payment as in D
            GW --> C : {paid: true}
          else not captured
            GW -> OS : cancelPendingOrder(order, "Khách hàng hủy giao dịch tại cổng SePay")
            OS -> OR : CANCELLED, restore stock and coupon, Payment PENDING to FAILED
            GW --> C : {paid: false}
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
note over GW
  Deposit and final invoices are not closed at SePay by this endpoint.
  Only the scheduler (PaymentTimeoutScheduler, 10.2 G) closes them after 24 hours.
  The customer order-cancel endpoint (POST /api/orders/{userId}/{orderId}/cancel)
  does not call SePay at all; it cancels in the database and fails PENDING payments.
end note

== I. Timeout (scheduler, same reconcile before cancel) ==
note over GW
  PaymentTimeoutScheduler every 5 seconds: PENDING older than 10 minutes
  (paymentWindowStart) and AWAITING_DEPOSIT older than 24 hours.
  expireUnpaidOrder: POST /v1/order/cancel for open invoices, reconcile,
  then cancelExpiredOrder when still unpaid.
end note

@enduml
